<title>UK: Banco de Credito Argentina prices $100 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Banco de Credito Argentina prices $100 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was priced, lead manager Salomon Brothers International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DE CREDITO ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  COUPON     8.50	MATURITY   *18.DEC.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    PAR	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	PUT AT PAR ON 18.DEC.97.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
